      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "李汉叫来李飞，给了他一个手表，说：“这个手表是你妈妈给我的。",
      "traditional": "李漢叫來李飛，給了他一個手錶，說：“這個手錶是你媽媽給我的。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ hàn jiào lái lǐ fēi gěi le tā yí ge shǒu biǎo shuō zhè ge shǒu biǎo shì nǐ mā ma gěi wǒ de",
      "english": "Li Han called Li Fei over, and gave him a watch, saying, “This watch is one that your mom gave me."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "她说，在你爱上一个人的时候，要给她这个手表。”",
      "traditional": "她說，在你愛上一個人的時候，要給她這個手錶。”",
      "pinyin": "tā shuō zài nǐ ài shàng yí ge rén de shí hou yào gěi tā zhè ge shǒu biǎo",
      "english": "She said that when you fall in love with someone, you must give her this watch.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "李飞看了看手表，说：“谢谢你，爸爸！”他拿起手表，出去了。",
      "traditional": "李飛看了看手錶，說：“謝謝你，爸爸！”他拿起手錶，出去了。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ fēi kàn le kàn shǒu biǎo shuō xiè xie nǐ bà ba tā ná qǐ shǒu biǎo chū qù le",
      "english": "Li Fei looked at the watch and said, “Thank you, Dad!” He took the watch and went out."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "在车站，李飞见到了小米。他们坐在出租车上，一起去电影院。",
      "traditional": "在車站，李飛見到了小米。他們坐在出租車上，一起去電影院。",
      "pinyin": "zài chē zhàn lǐ fēi jiàn dào le xiǎo mǐ tā men zuò zài chū zū chē shang yì qǐ qù diàn yǐng yuàn",
      "english": "At the train station, Li Fei saw Little Mi. They sat in the taxi to go together to the movie theater."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小米对司机说：“司机，快！我的妈妈不喜欢等人。”",
      "traditional": "小米對司機說：“司機，快！我的媽媽不喜歡等人。”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo mǐ duì sī jī shuō sī jī kuài wǒ de mā ma bù xǐ huan děng rén",
      "english": "Little Mi said to the driver, “Driver, quick! My mom doesn’t like waiting for people.”"
    },
