    "sentence_translations": [
      "",
      "Li Fei was going to see Little Mi.",
      "",
      "Li Han called Li Fei over, and gave him a watch, saying, “This watch is one that your mom gave me.",
      "She said that when you fall in love with someone, you must give her this watch.”",
      "",
      "Li Fei looked at the watch and said, “Thank you, Dad!” He took the watch and went out.",
      "",
      "At the train station, Li Fei saw Little Mi. They sat in the taxi to go together to the movie theater.",
      "",
      "Little Mi said to the driver, “Driver, quick! My mom doesn’t like waiting for people.”",
      "",
      "The driver set off, driving very quickly.",
      ""
